Wrote the label file: one row for Soliday / `gun-policy`, chair 5, resting on the HB 1296 (2022) roll call vote (Yea, Soliday's surname and the tally verbatim from the roll call PDF) and the enrolled bill text, whose non-deleted operative text states a person "is not required to obtain or possess a license or permit from the state to carry a handgun in Indiana" — matching rung 5's permitless-carry language rather than rung 4's more modest reciprocity-only loosening. The bill-details/authors page (Soliday isn't listed as author/co-author) wasn't used since it attributes nothing to him.
